      "derivation": "Altitude scale H = 2000 km represents the characteristic altitude at which the TEP scalar field is suppressed by Earth's density profile; this is derived from the exponential screening model S = exp(-h/H) where H is the characteristic scale height; \u00b11000 km uncertainty accounts for uncertainty in Earth's density profile and the screening model",
